            <ArticleTitle>Acute meningitis from Cryptococcus neoformans (Filobasidiella neoformans) in a patient suffering from AIDS. Report of a clinical case with a favourable outcome.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>341-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The Authors describe a case of acute meningitis from Cryptococcus neoformans, with the finding of the fungus in the cerebrospinal fluid and in culture in a young subject with AIDS. The case had a favourable outcome after fluconazole treatment.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
